  "reasoning": "The defendant Wang deceived the victim Hong by falsely claiming he could purchase a house at a discount and used related pretenses (garage purchase, house registration) to obtain RMB 115,000, which constitutes fraud (诈骗). After the victim intended to report the fraud, Wang himself filed a false report with the police, claiming the victim had defrauded him of RMB 640,000, and had his associate provide false testimony, aiming to have the victim criminally prosecuted. This act of making a false accusation to the authorities is the crime of false accusation/defamation (诬告陷害). Therefore, the applicable crimes are fraud and false accusation.",
  "final_answer": "[罪名]诈骗;诬告陷害<eoa>"
}
